318	     * telephone, email and {@link #householdId}. Two owners are duplicates exactly when
319	     * their whole identity keys are equal, so members of the same household with
320	     * different telephones have different keys. Derived (not persisted); recomputed each
321	     * call. See {@link OwnerDerivations#identityKey(String, String, String)} for the
322	     * exact format.
