333	     * {@code <REGION>-<HASH8>} from the owner's (already normalised) fields. This is the
334	     * value stored in {@link #getCustomerCode()}; see
335	     * {@link OwnerDerivations#customerCode(String, String, String)} for the format.
336	     *
